WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Maintenance opens Reports.
A new submission and a defect report show up here.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Open the defect. Acknowledge as received when it is new.
Start the job when you take it on.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Work orders list the open jobs.
Red Not roadworthy shows when the job has an open defect.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
On the machine page, Service intervals shows the next service.
The driver sees the same information as a colour.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Record a completed service on the machine page.
Choose the action, the day and the reading, and press Record service.
